Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Sophie! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Velza...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.11,0:00:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, that's enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Velza...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your despair...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing everyone important to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Being betrayed by the people you love...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody understanding...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.09,0:01:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All the suffering you've endured...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.11,0:01:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Velza...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been so hard for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.99,0:01:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All that sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,After all you went through...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:01:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:02:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I can do to ease your pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.30,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But even still...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only causing yourself more pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The world that you wanted to build...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you who was right, Gilbert...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.73,0:04:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's time for my exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, flame user.
